@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Expert Calculates Borehole Risk

actor Expert
participant "Web Application" as App
participant "Risk Prediction Service" as ML
database "SQLite Database" as DB
participant "District Officer" as DO

Expert -> App: Select borehole
App -> DB: Retrieve borehole information
DB --> App: Return borehole details
Expert -> App: Click Calculate Risk
App -> ML: Request risk prediction
ML -> DB: Load required borehole features
DB --> ML: Return feature values
ML -> ML: Predict failure probability
ML --> App: Return risk score
App -> DB: Save prediction and Expert ID
DB --> App: Confirm saved result

alt Risk score >= 60%
    App -> DB: Save high-risk notification
    DB --> App: Notification saved
    App -> DO: Make high-risk alert available
end

App --> Expert: Display risk result
@enduml
